      "message": "Allocate an EF_RISCV_RVY e_flag for RVY\n\nThe toolchain should set this flag to indicate that the ELF file uses\nthe RVY base ISA and an appropriate pure-capability ABI.\nFuture pull requests will define the pure-capability ABIs for RVY as\nwell as the associated calling conventions.",
